# Witnesses for the complete shear coefficient kernel

The first test is reduced modulo the thirteen actual radical generators.
All 1212 nonpivot residues reconstruct all 1275 inputs from 63 free entries.
The second test gives 62 equations on those 63 entries and reconstructs them
from one free entry. The final lifted direction is the shared finalParameter.

These numbers are untrusted output of Kernel/source/generate.py. Reduction
proves their meaning and the checked modules verify every required identity.
-/

